{
  "length_scale": 1.08,
  "total": 50.73,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l01",
      "text": "You think you're trapped inside this moment.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "dur": 2.048,
      "end": 2.048,
      "gap": 0.25
    },
    {
      "id": "l02",
      "text": "That's the whole malfunction.",
      "start": 2.298,
      "dur": 1.536,
      "end": 3.834,
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "id": "l03",
      "text": "You've mistaken a single frame for the entire reel.",
      "start": 4.384,
      "dur": 2.48,
      "end": 6.864,
      "gap": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "l04",
      "text": "Contraction is the physics of loss. Not proof that something's wrong with you.",
      "start": 7.564,
      "dur": 4.182,
      "end": 11.746,
      "gap": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "l05",
      "text": "The low isn't a failure. It's a coordinate.",
      "start": 12.346,
      "dur": 2.374,
      "end": 14.72,
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "id": "l06",
      "text": "You cannot draw a wave with only its peaks.",
      "start": 15.17,
      "dur": 2.448,
      "end": 17.618,
      "gap": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l07",
      "text": "The trough is what gives the peak its height.",
      "start": 17.918,
      "dur": 2.192,
      "end": 20.11,
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "id": "l08",
      "text": "The depth isn't happening to the arc. The depth is the arc.",
      "start": 20.66,
      "dur": 3.382,
      "end": 24.042,
      "gap": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "l09",
      "text": "You are not the frame you're on. You're the awareness watching it.",
      "start": 24.742,
      "dur": 3.014,
      "end": 27.756,
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "text": "The reel keeps moving whether you grip this frame or not.",
      "start": 28.206,
      "dur": 2.72,
      "end": 30.926,
      "gap": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "text": "Scarcity is a search function. It scans for not enough, and finds it. Every time.",
      "start": 31.626,
      "dur": 5.052,
      "end": 36.678,
      "gap": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "l12",
      "text": "Ask only what's true in the three feet around your body. Breath. Weight. Sound.",
      "start": 37.278,
      "dur": 5.122,
      "end": 42.4,
      "gap": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "l13",
      "text": "This isn't your permanent address. It's the compression phase.",
      "start": 43.1,
      "dur": 3.638,
      "end": 46.738,
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "id": "l14",
      "text": "Your only job is to stop adding weight. And let it complete.",
      "start": 47.188,
      "dur": 3.542,
      "end": 50.73,
      "gap": 0.0
    }
  ]
}